rom this template by setup-workspace.sh at install and by update.sh Phase 5d at update, so anything added to it is migrated out and replaced. Put operator additions — extra permissions, env, custom hooks — in .claude/settings.local.json (Layer 2, operator-owned, git-ignored), which Claude Code merges natively and the platform never regenerates; the installer and updater scaffold it empty for you. See ADR-121 and docs/UPDATE.md.",
